 must be in position 2 (because position 1's left is nothing, so only position 2 is adjacent to position 1).\n\nNow we have:\n- Position 1: videographer\n- Position 2: pakistani, watches animation\n\nNow assign the remaining attributes:\n- Jobs: videographer (position 1), so position 2 must be freelancer (since jobs are unique).\n- Movie-Genres: animation (position 2), so position 1 must watch thriller (since genres are unique).\n- Nationalities: pakistani (position 2), so position 1 must be nigerian (since nationalities are unique).\n\n### Final assignments:\n- Position 1: videographer, thriller, nigerian\n- Position 2: freelancer, animation, pakistani\n\n### Answers to the questions:\n1. What is the job of the person who is pakistani?\n   - Pakistani is in position 2, job is freelancer.\n\n2. What is the movie genre of the person who is pakistani?\n   - Pakistani is in position 2, movie genre is animation.\n\n3. What movie genre does the person in position 1 watch?\n   - Position 1 watches thriller.\n\n4. At what position is the person who is a videographer?\n   - Videographer is in position 1.\n\n<solution>freelancer, animation, thriller, 1</solution>\n\nFinal answer: <answer>freelancer, animation, thriller, 1</answer>", "logprobs": [{"token": "Let", "logprob": -0.044953081756830215}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.001762028899975121}, {"token": " analyze", "logprob": -0.35841473937034607}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.00038938093348406255}, {"token": " problem", "logprob": -0.47908079624176025}, {"token": " step", "logprob": -0.00012730741582345217}, {"token": " by", "logprob": -0.016046548262238503}, {"token": " step", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": ".\n\n", "logprob": -0.17830373346805573}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -0.5804945230484009}, {"token": " Given", "logprob": -0.04042259231209755}, {"token": ":\n", "logprob": -0.807314395904541}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -0.07128576934337616}, {"token": " There", "logprob": -0.35608047246932983}, {